fr:mainmatter.html:p:
Let \pi : \mathfrak {p} \to \mathfrak {l} be the Levi projection, with kernel \mathfrak {n}_{c}. The degree-0 part of the graded centralizer basis is the thread algebra \mathfrak {s} = \pi (\mathfrak {z}(y_1)),
with basis elements X_{s \to t} = \sum _{a \in I_s \cap I_t} E^{(a)}_{t,s}
over index pairs with i(s) \le i(t), j(s) \le j(t), j(s) \ge i(t).
